WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.420
Someone once said...

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:55.020
There is a fruit that 
looks just like a peach,

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:58.430
and when fully ripened, swells up like mochi

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:02.230
and changes to a springy texture 
like traditional sweets...

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:06.330
Mo-peachi!

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:16.640
There are acorns that have the aroma of 
sweet vanilla and taste like custard...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:20.780
Custacorns!

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.550
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:31.590
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:40.770
Toriko found the first Melk and 
successfully acquired Melk Stardust.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:45.300
Meanwhile, Komatsu used the 
second generation Melk's knives

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.670
to prepare a wonderful meal.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:54.450
At last, Melk gained confidence in 
herself as a professional cutler.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:03:01.050
She used the Melk Stardust that Toriko 
brought back as a sharpening stone

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:05.660
to attempt to complete 
a new knife for Komatsu!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:13.270
A Work Made with All Her Might! 
The Completed Melk Knife!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.570
Wow!

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:23.480
You're getting there, Melk-san...

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:27.650
Still, this Deros fang is something else...

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:29.950
I didn't expect it to be this hard...

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.950
Even under thousands of degrees of 
heat, it doesn't become malleable.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:39.320
So I can't forge it, that is, change 
its shape by striking it with a hammer.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.390
I'll just have to shave it down with 
Melk Stardust, little by little.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:47.770
And you've already been 
shaving it for days now...

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:53.040
D-Delicious! What is this?!

00:03:55.970 --> 00:04:02.180
H-Hey! Toriko-san, don't tell me you 
ate the Melk Stardust seasoning?!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.250
Why did you eat that first?!

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:10.850
You promised the three of us would eat 
it together when my knife was finished!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.820
You glutton!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.260
I'm not eatin' it!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:19.500
See, it's takin' forever to 
finish making that knife,

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.930
so I was just practicing my 
reaction to eating Melk Stardust.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:27.840
What the heck is that?!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.010
The stuff smells wonderful!

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:34.310
This spice hits me square in the 
appetite with tremendous force!

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:37.710
It's a totally new kind of flavor component 
that I've never smelled before...

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.780
It's gotta be delicious!

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.860
I'm almost finished with it.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.770
Just wait a little longer.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.830
Chef Komatsu, I heated up 
your knife to soften it,

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.230
and now I'll hit it with this hammer.

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.170
While tempering the 
materials with the hammer,

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.300
I'm going to join it together 
with the fang of Deros.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.060
This feels great...

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.690
Um, Toriko-san...?

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:35.790
Yeah?

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:40.370
Did you know Melk-san was a 
female from the beginning?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.500
Yeah.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.410
I was suspicious she was 
a fake right off the bat.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.180
And I was right, but actually...

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:56.110
Well, you know the truth, right, Komatsu?

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:59.780
Yes. She's the first Melk-san's daughter.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:04.120
She inherited all of his cutlery techniques 
and is his rightful successor.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:08.790
And while I was off getting Melk Stardust,

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:11.660
she really did become the 
true second generation Melk.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:16.100
In other words, you fulfilled 
your role perfectly.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.070
My role...?

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:24.210
You said "division of labor".

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.140
So basically, what should I do?

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:30.550
Just staying with Melk is fine.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:34.550
It's something I can't do, but is 
an important job for you alone.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:38.120
Th-Then my job was...

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:41.120
Right now, Melk's doubts are gone

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.590
and she's filled with confidence 
as a first-rate cutler.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.700
Komatsu... You changed Melk.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:51.000
I just wanted to...

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.440
...let Melk-san know how 
amazing her knives were.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:56.210
And then...

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:05.150
But if it was the food that 
gave Melk-san peace of mind

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:09.280
and let her put her heart into her work, 
then I'm happy to have done my part.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:14.390
Melk-san should stop forcing 
herself to act like a man

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.890
and let herself be a girl naturally.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.890
After all, she's really cute...

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.730
Huh? Ah! Komatsu!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.700
Don't tell me you're in love with Melk?!

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:27.600
No, no! That's not what I...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.500
Don't hide it! There's nothin' wrong with it!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.770
No, I'm not hiding anything! 
But it's not like that!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:38.210
I warn you, though, Melk's 
dad is totally scary!

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.380
You mean the first generation Melk-san?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.150
Really?

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:44.920
Yeah. He's a real ogre!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.050
An ogre?

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.360
Is he really an ogre?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.760
It's true...

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:19.490
I don't believe it...

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:39.710
How sharp is this...?

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.140
I just swung it lightly... 
and the mountain split...

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:49.710
Is this what a knife made from a 
Deros fang and Melk Stardust is?

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.520
The bath is in that direction!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.990
That's where Chef Komatsu 
and Toriko are! Oh, no!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:03.060
Melk! Is the knife finished?!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.960
It is finished at last, isn't it?!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.530
Show us, Melk!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.900
<i>Don't</i> show me that down there!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:11.840
Show you what?!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.910
That! What you've got down there! Hide it!

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:17.140
Hey, don't hide the knife!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.280
I-I'm not hiding it! Look!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:29.920
Komatsu... Melk the Second...

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.290
This is the first time I've carved in a seal.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:40.300
It's a mark of my gratitude and 
respect towards you, Chef Komatsu.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:45.000
Thank you, Melk-san!

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.970
This is proof that she put everything 
of her true self into the work.

00:10:57.810 --> 00:10:59.120
Alright!

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.220
Tonight we'll feast...

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.090
...on Melk Stardust!

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.960
Yeah!

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:10.330
But first put some clothes on! Please!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:30.480
Mmm... That... and that... and that...

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.020
Is this...?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:40.820
It is! Don Acorn!

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.260
And it's king-sized...

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.430
What's wrong, Chef Komatsu?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:54.240
Would I be able to cut this with the 
knife you made for me, Melk-san?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:05.680
Chef Komatsu... Just be very careful 
with how much force you use.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.150
I will!

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:23.250
Just then, my knife split open 
a harder than rock Don Acorn...

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.420
It cut right through it, Toriko-san!

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:28.630
That sure is a Melk knife then...

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:32.500
You should be able to cut through 
any Don Acorn like that,

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.830
no matter what the size.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:44.270
This is my first trip since becoming 
partners with you, Toriko-san,

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:48.510
and my idol, Melk-san, made 
me a knife! I'm deeply moved!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:53.120
Now I'll be able to make even more 
kinds of food for you, Toriko-san.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.450
Plus...

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.620
I was successful getting Melk Stardust!

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:02.130
This trip was good training to prepare 
for conquering the Gourmet World.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.960
Cured ham from a Plumed Pig...

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:08.000
The more transparently thin you slice it,

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.230
the more exquisite the salty 
seasoning and rich flavor.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.010
Onion Bananas.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.740
It's said that if you don't 
cut it systematically,

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.650
being careful not to damage 
the minuscule cells...

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:25.650
...a strong enzyme is produced

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:29.750
that makes the chef cry 
his eyes out for 24 hours.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.660
Wow! Even precision cutting is a snap!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:37.960
I've never felt this sensation before now!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.430
Good for you, Komatsu!

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:41.730
I know!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.850
D-Delicious... What is this?!

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.790
Did you start eating that without us?!

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.560
You glutton!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.990
I told you, I'm practicing!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:15.260
Again?! Jeez!

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.700
I'm almost done with one dish,

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.400
so both of you please be 
patient just a little more.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.580
Thank you for waiting.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:34.110
Cured ham from a Plumed 
Pig pizza, Melk Special!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.220
It smells like delicious 
sweet and spicy sauce!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:37.950
Yep!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:42.520
I put on plenty of Don Acorns, 
too! Please help yourselves!

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:46.060
Alright! I'm gonna eat, Komatsu!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:46.860
Please.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:50.100
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.870
Let us eat!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.230
We give thanks!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.210
Nummy!

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.180
It's great, Chef Komatsu.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:12.180
I can't get enough of the balance between 
the superb salty flavor of the ham

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:14.650
and the condensed sweetness of the onions!

00:16:14.650 --> 00:16:19.520
That and the Don Acorn's texture and aroma...

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.160
This could become a habit!

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:33.570
And now, the long-awaited... main event!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:36.610
Melk Stardust! I thought it'd never come!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.050
Okay, here I go.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.020
Awesome!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.020
Okay, one more time...

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.760
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.530
Let us eat!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.830
We give thanks!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.170
Everyone, line up!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.380
The prisoners are here!

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:44.210
Lemme out!

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.680
Get me outta here!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:51.680
Shut up, Gourmet criminals!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:57.350
Your sentence was handed down 
at your trial! So give it up!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.390
You're as lively as always, huh?

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:05.130
Y-You...?!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:10.330
What do you call that hairstyle anyway?

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.230
President!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:17.300
Well, well! I haven't seen you 
in a long time, President!

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:21.210
So you're bald on top, huh?

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:26.480
Chief Love is here, isn't he... Pricom-kun?

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:31.190
Yosaku, the Bloodstained Reviver, too?!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.720
I always appreciate your hard work!

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.860
Tell me about it...

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:39.630
It's because of those 
shiftless Gourmet Police...

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.960
We Revivers are just too damn busy.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:46.670
I'd like to speak with Love about Zebra...

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.800
Z-Zebra, you say?!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:54.340
I don't know if Chief Love will 
be open to that, President...

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:59.880
That's why I, the President of IGO, 
came here myself, along with Yosaku,

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:05.250
the master of Teppei, who captured 
Zebra with a little help from Yosaku.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:09.220
Sending IGO Legal Affairs Chief 
Glass would've been a waste of time.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:13.590
Y-Yes, sir! Then I'll contact 
the chief right away!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:14.390
Quickly!

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:15.930
Y-Yes, sir!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:21.030
Zebra already knows it...

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:24.740
That the two of us are just above him...

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:30.540
He could attack at any time...

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.790
Two guests...

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:54.600
Do they finally feel like letting me out?

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:06.940
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:10.240
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.840
Our guest today is Knocking Master Jiro-san!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.710
...Knocking Master Jiro-san!

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.550
...Jiro-san!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.550
Alright, let's get right to seeing 
what makes our guest tick!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.320
This is my first time meeting Jiro-san,

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.460
so I've got a heaping helping of questions!

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:34.760
This time, we'll play rock-scissors-paper 
and whoever loses has to give

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:40.630
a heaping helping of talk about the most 
delicious experience in their life...

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:47.470
Hey! Hey! Hey...

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.040
Okay...

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.740
Ready?

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:56.550
Not snoring! Jiro-san, please wake up!

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:58.320
Ready, one-two...

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.360
What's that? A peace sign?

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:03.920
Is it a peace sign?

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.590
Peace, huh? Are you taking a 
photo with your cell phone?

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.160
Or scissors? Are those scissors?

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:11.060
I didn't finish counting yet, so 
you're too fast with the scissors...

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:17.070
Let's do rock-scissors-paper! Ready...

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:20.470
Not ready to start snoring!

00:22:20.470 --> 00:22:23.410
Now, rock-scissors-paper! 1-2-3!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.920
Too late! And even then, you lost!

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:39.760
Okay, so let's hear about the most delicious 
experience in Jiro-san's life...

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:47.100
Alright, let's just go 
on to the next segment...

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:49.070
Setsuno...

00:22:49.070 --> 00:22:51.340
Did you just say "Setsuno"?!

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:54.340
Tell me! Tell me! Did something 
happen between you and Setsuno?!

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:56.010
Come on, Jiro-san!

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:57.980
Tell me! Tell me! What happened?!

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:02.110
Oh, come on! Jiro-san! Jiro-san!

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:05.020
Jiro-san!!

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:10.320
Toriko's next adventure is a luxury trip around the world!

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:11.990
Wait, Coco and Sunny are going too?

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.020
Where exactly are they going?!

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:16.990
Super Celeb! Once in a Lifetime Gourmet Carriage Journey!

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:19.040
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
